ay and quests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE &amp; PLUNDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283580/extras/cb7aae19fe78af215c4524da021db8df.poster.avif?t=1752864943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283580/extras/cb7aae19fe78af215c4524da021db8df.webm?t=1752864943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283580/extras/cb7aae19fe78af215c4524da021db8df.mp4?t=1752864943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Secure coveted items through chests, quests, mining, or strategic purchases, and transform them into your desired creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283580/extras/29e3eaa5ee823ed034d2b8f0fe112ac1.poster.avif?t=1752864943\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283580/extras/29e3eaa5ee823ed034d2b8f0fe112ac1.webm?t=1752864943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283580/extras/29e3eaa5ee823ed034d2b8f0fe112ac1.mp4?t=1752864943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Survival is an art, where a powerful rifle may be easily acquired through charming the locals in some realms, in others you might need to work hard to scavenge for the humblest of resources. Adapt your strategies according to your standing in the food chain and take the necessary precautions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this adventure solo or join forces with friends.</p>",
